{
  "$defs": {
    "TaskRequestEnvelope": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "M43 新 task family 的严格信封；delta/state/route/evidence 均不能由客户端提交。",
      "properties": {
        "action": {
          "enum": [
            "start",
            "continue",
            "switch",
            "cancel"
          ],
          "title": "Action",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "expected_version": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Expected Version"
        },
        "task_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxLength": 128,
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Task Id"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "action"
      ],
      "title": "TaskRequestEnvelope",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "description": "自然语言查询请求。\n\n`user_role` 在 M35 起只表示请求者选择的 active role：应用组装层必须先通过 caller\nresolver 把它解析为可信 fixture / authenticated caller，才能进入 SQL Guard 或知识 ACL。\n`force_new_pipeline` 是新旧 Text2SQL 的兼容开关：默认 True，让普通 API 与 M27 Eval 都走\nSchema Retrieval → QueryPlan → SQL Guard 的新 pipeline；显式传 False 才暂时回到 legacy\nbaseline，供兼容排障使用。\n`schema_retrieval_profile` 是本地实验开关：默认不传时沿用环境变量；演示页可显式选择\nMilvus + Qwen embedding，方便 Phase 3 RAG / Hybrid 前手动对比。\n`schema_fusion_strategy` 是 M21 的受控实验开关：默认 `weighted` 保持既有排序，只有显式\n传 `rrf` 才会改用 rank-based fusion；它不改变默认检索或响应契约。",
  "properties": {
    "clarification_answers": {
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Clarification Answers",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "enable_bounded_follow_up": {
      "default": false,
      "title": "Enable Bounded Follow Up",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "expected_version": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "minimum": 1,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Expected Version"
    },
    "follow_up_action": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "enum": [
            "adjust_sql_scope",
            "explain_same_evidence",
            "ask_related_evidence"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Follow Up Action"
    },
    "follow_up_fields": {
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Follow Up Fields",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "force_new_pipeline": {
      "default": true,
      "title": "Force New Pipeline",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "question": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Question",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "schema_fusion_strategy": {
      "default": "weighted",
      "enum": [
        "weighted",
        "rrf"
      ],
      "title": "Schema Fusion Strategy",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "schema_retrieval_profile": {
      "default": "default",
      "enum": [
        "default",
        "milvus_qwen37"
      ],
      "title": "Schema Retrieval Profile",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "task": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/TaskRequestEnvelope"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null
    },
    "thread_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Thread Id"
    },
    "user_role": {
      "default": "ops",
      "title": "User Role",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "question"
  ],
  "title": "QueryRequest",
  "type": "object"
}
